<svg viewBox="0 0 720 380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Four buckets of evaluation criteria, applied to a contract-summary example">
  <text x="360" y="30" font-size="14" font-weight="550" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink)">Task: “summarize this legal contract” — one output, four questions to ask of it</text>

  <rect x="40" y="56" width="310" height="130" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-inset)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" />
  <text x="60" y="84" font-size="13.5" font-weight="550" fill="var(--ink)">Domain-specific capability</text>
  <text x="60" y="106" font-size="11.5" fill="var(--ink-soft)">Does the model understand legal contracts?</text>
  <text x="60" y="126" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· bounded by architecture, size, training data</text>
  <text x="60" y="144" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· measured with exact eval: benchmarks, MCQs,</text>
  <text x="68" y="160" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">functional correctness for code</text>

  <rect x="370" y="56" width="310" height="130" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-inset)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" />
  <text x="390" y="84" font-size="13.5" font-weight="550" fill="var(--ink)">Generation capability</text>
  <text x="390" y="106" font-size="11.5" fill="var(--ink-soft)">Is the summary coherent, faithful, safe?</text>
  <text x="390" y="126" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· fluency &amp; coherence (mostly solved)</text>
  <text x="390" y="144" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· factual consistency (the big one)</text>
  <text x="390" y="160" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· safety: toxicity, stereotypes, biases</text>

  <rect x="40" y="206" width="310" height="130" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-inset)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" />
  <text x="60" y="234" font-size="13.5" font-weight="550" fill="var(--ink)">Instruction-following capability</text>
  <text x="60" y="256" font-size="11.5" fill="var(--ink-soft)">Did it obey YOUR constraints?</text>
  <text x="60" y="276" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· requested format (JSON, length, keywords)</text>
  <text x="60" y="294" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· content/style/linguistic constraints</text>
  <text x="60" y="312" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· benchmarks: IFEval, INFOBench · roleplaying</text>

  <rect x="370" y="206" width="310" height="130" rx="10" fill="var(--bg-inset)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" />
  <text x="390" y="234" font-size="13.5" font-weight="550" fill="var(--ink)">Cost and latency</text>
  <text x="390" y="256" font-size="11.5" fill="var(--ink-soft)">What does each summary cost, and how long?</text>
  <text x="390" y="276" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· TTFT, time per token, time per query</text>
  <text x="390" y="294" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· $/token (API) or compute (self-hosted)</text>
  <text x="390" y="312" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink-soft)">· Pareto trade-off: know what you can't compromise</text>

  <text x="360" y="366" font-size="12" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--ink-soft)">Evaluation-driven development: define these criteria before you build, like tests before code.</text>
</svg>
